      ],
      "source": "https://www.thomaswestvirginia.com/about"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "At its peak, Davis Coal and Coke employed 1,600 workers from Austria, Russia, Poland, Italy, and Jewish communities, needing an interpreter fluent in eight languages.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
