      ],
      "source": "https://www.thomaswestvirginia.com/about"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1901 fire destroyed 83 buildings in less than two hours, but Thomas was quickly rebuilt with fine hotels and a new opera house.",
